data-tex=\"P\\subseteq A\\times A\">\\(P\\subseteq A\\times A\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}\\)</span>。端点 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b\">\\(a,b\\)</span> 仅在相应断言中有界量化，允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=\\varnothing\">\\(A=\\varnothing\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P^0:=\\{(a,a):a\\in A\\},\\qquad\nP^{n+1}:=\\{(a,c)\\in A^2:\\exists b\\in A\\;((a,b)\\in P^n\\land(b,c)\\in P)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P^0:=\\{(a,a):a\\in A\\},\\qquad\nP^{n+1}:=\\{(a,c)\\in A^2:\\exists b\\in A\\;((a,b)\\in P^n\\land(b,c)\\in P)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"P^*:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}P^n,\\qquad\nP^+:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}}P^n,\\qquad\nP^{-1}:=\\{(b,a):(a,b)\\in P\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[P^*:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}P^n,\\qquad\nP^+:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}}P^n,\\qquad\nP^{-1}:=\\{(b,a):(a,b)\\in P\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall a,b\\in A\\;\\Bigl(a\\to^*b\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;(a,b)\\in(\\to)^*\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall a,b\\in A\\;\\Bigl(a\\to^*b\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;(a,b)\\in(\\to)^*\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall a,b\\in A\\;\\Bigl(a\\to^+b\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;(a,b)\\in(\\to)^+\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall a,b\\in A\\;\\Bigl(a\\to^+b\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;(a,b)\\in(\\to)^+\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall a,b\\in A\\;\\Bigl(a\\leftrightarrow^*b\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;(a,b)\\in(\\to\\cup(\\to)^{-1})^*\\Bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall a,b\\in A\\;\\Bigl(a\\leftrightarrow^*b\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;(a,b)\\in(\\to\\cup(\\to)^{-1})^*\\Bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>用自然数递归构造有限步闭包；每一步均为确定的集合构造，含零步。原书用双箭头表示自反传递闭包、用等号样记号表示可转换性，本目录改用→*和↔*以区分语法相等。</p>\n<p>来源定位中的 <code>source_ocr_blocks</code> 指本地提取文本的页块序号，不宣称是DjVu物理页码；印刷页已按该页页眉或页脚核对。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-abstract-reduction-system","status":"resolved","id":"89129816153530db","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-abstract-reduction-system]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-abstract-reduction-system","status":"resolved","id":"89129816153530db","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$A$ 为集合，$\\to\\subseteq A\\times A$；单关系抽象归约系统见 [[56-df-abstract-reduction-system]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\to\\subseteq A\\times A","display":false},{"tex":"P\\subseteq A\\times A","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb N=\\{0,1,2,\\ldots\\}","display":false},{"tex":"a,b","display":false},{"tex":"A=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"P^0:=\\{(a,a):a\\in A\\},\\qquad\nP^{n+1}:=\\{(a,c)\\in A^2:\\exists b\\in A\\;((a,b)\\in P^n\\land(b,c)\\in P)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"P^*:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}P^n,\\qquad\nP^+:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N\\setminus\\{0\\}}P^n,\\qquad\nP^{-1}:=\\{(b,a):(a,b)\\in P\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall a,b\\in A\\;\\Bigl(a\\to^*b\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;(a,b)\\in(\\to)^*\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall a,b\\in A\\;\\Bigl(a\\to^+b\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;(a,b)\\in(\\to)^+\\Bigr).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall a,b\\in A\\;\\Bigl(a\\leftrightarrow^*b\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;(a,b)\\in(\\to\\cup(\\to)^{-1})^*\\Bigr).","display":true}],"bytes":1749,"backlinks":[{"id":"45e20be1a6b32031","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\leftrightarrow^*$ 见 [[56-df-relation-closure]]，$\\mathrm{Join}$ 见 [[56-df-joinable]]。"},{"id":"e22d9797b2ac34d5","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{FunctionalReductionStrategy}$ 与 $F^{[n]}$ 见 [[56-df-many-step-functional-strategy]]；$\\to^*$ 见 [[56-df-relation-closure]]。"},{"id":"5e157b5303bf9951","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$B\\subseteq A$；$\\to^*$ 见 [[56-df-relation-closure]]。"},{"id":"875e72f69ea30655","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$T$ 为集合，$X\\subseteq T^2$，$s,t\\in T$，$m\\in\\{0,1,2\\}$。$X^*$、$X^{-1}$ 见 [[56-df-relation-closure]]，$\\mathrm{Join}(T,X,s,t)$ 见 [[56-df-joinable]]。本节点引入谓词符号 $\\mathrm{CSat}_{T,m}(X,s,t)$，其定义在Assertion中给出。模式 $0,1,2$ 分别编码转换条件、可汇合条件、定向有限归约条件；模式2本身不包含对右侧目标的正规形要求。"},{"id":"2a8ab98bbdc29f05","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"给定 $C\\subseteq\\mathrm{CondRule}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$，$T=\\mathcal T(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$。替换 $\\sigma\\in\\mathrm{Sub}(\\Sigma,\\mathcal V)$，项位置、子项与替换子项见 [[56-df-position]]、[[56-df-replace]]。给定 $s,t\\in T$；对关系 $X\\subseteq T^2$，$\\leftrightarrow_X^*$ 是 $X$ 的自反、对称、传递闭包，见 [[56-df-relation-closure]]。$c_i,d_i$ 是规则条件序列中的配对