luent]]；菱形到合流见 [[56-thm-diamond-confluence]]。"},{"id":"d344b982e3ec8df3","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["89129816153530db"]}